{"id":"vdvoe","lemma":"вдвое","pos":"adv","rank":2844,"glosses":["twice","in half"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0d/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B4%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты вдвое сильнее меня.","en":"You're twice as strong as me.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"strong, powerful","l":"сильный"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Его комната вдвое больше моей.","en":"His room is twice as large as mine.","words":[{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"room"},null,{"g":"any more"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"}]},{"text":"Вы вдвое старше меня.","en":"You're twice as old as me.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"elder, older, senior","l":"старший"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Я вдвое старше вас.","en":"I'm twice as old as you are.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"elder, older, senior","l":"старший"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Он вдвое старше неё.","en":"He is twice as old as she is.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"elder, older, senior","l":"старший"},null]}]}